stability - exercise kernel resource limits

SYNOPSIS
    stability

DESCRIPTION
    Check that system calls reject invalid arguments and that
    memory, process slots, and filesystem space are reusable after
    exhaustion. Run in a quiet guest with a disposable disk image.

FILES
    /tmp/stability   Temporary directory for the full-disk check.

EXIT STATUS
    0   All checks passed.
    1   A check failed.

SEE ALSO
    fsck(1)
